# Convert an intergalactic message into its transmit sequence.
# TransmitSequence ? Message
TransmitSequence ← |1 ≡(°⋯⇌) ≡˜⊂ ⊸(◿2 ≡/+) ⬚0↯[∘ ⊙7] ⊃(⌈÷7 ×9 ⧻|≡(⇌⋯₈))

# Decode a transmit sequence into its original intergalactic message.
# Message ? TransmitSequence
DecodeMessage ← |1 ⨬(⨬(⨬(∘|↘¯1)↧⊸⊃(=0⊣|>0⧻) ≡(°⋯⇌) ⬚0↯[∘ ⊙8] ⊸(⌈÷8 ×7 ⧻) ≡↘¯1 ⍤"wrong parity" ⊸(¬/↥≡/(◿2+)) ≡(⇌⋯₈)|[]) ⊸(≍[])|[0]) ⊸(≍[0]◴)